  "description": "Ban Village, a lawless area in Hanyang, is home to butchers who make their living by slaughtering cattle. It’s a refuge for those seeking to escape their past crimes. Su-yeon, whose family faces serious charges, is forced into a desperate situation. Her escape leads her to marry a giant butcher from Ban Village, a man whose imposing presence initially frightens her. Over time, she begins to see a different side of him, softened by his unexpected kindness.\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
